    "meeting.callEndOffer.unnamed" : {
      "comment" : "Question in a small panel at the top right of the screen while a meeting records, when the call heard during the recording has not used the microphone for 30 seconds, which Vocula takes for the end of the call. Shown under the app's name when the app can be named, alone when it cannot. Answered by two buttons, Keep Recording and Stop Recording; the panel is about 320 points wide and wraps.",
