    "meeting.status.cannotStart" : {
      "comment" : "Menu line after Record failed, shown until Dismiss or the next recording; also spoken by VoiceOver when it appears. \"login keychain\" is Apple's name: write it as a Mac set to this language shows it (see Localization/glossary.md). Drawn on one menu line that does not wrap: a longer translation widens the whole menu, so keep it as short as the meaning allows.",
